{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"building-a-design-system","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Building a design system"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Kirana is a compiler, not a design system. This repository builds one on top of\nit — the shadcn/ui component set, rebuilt — and its shape is worth copying."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"six-layers","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Six layers"}]},{"type":"component","name":"figure-design-system","attributes":{},"children":[]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1 · Scales."}]},{"type":"text","value":" Plain constants: the palette, spacing, type ramp, radii,\ndurations. Inlined, so they cost nothing.\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tokens/preset-scales","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@kirana-style/preset-scales","source":"@kirana-style/preset-scales"}}]},{"type":"text","value":" gives you Tailwind's."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2 · Semantic tokens."}]},{"type":"text","value":" What the scales "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"mean"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"background","source":"background"}},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"foreground","source":"foreground"}},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"card","source":"card"}},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"border","source":"border"}},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"primary","source":"primary"}},{"type":"text","value":" — as variable tokens, every colour a "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-function\">light-dark</span>()","source":"light-dark()"}},{"type":"text","value":"\npair. This is the layer a theme overrides.\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tokens/semantic-tokens","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Semantic tokens"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3 · Conditions."}]},{"type":"text","value":" The relations components share (a menu item reading its\nmenu's state), context tokens a parent hands down ("},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"iconSize","source":"iconSize"}},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sidebarWidth","source":"sidebarWidth"}},{"type":"text","value":"),\nand the keyframes. Declared once, in one module each."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"4 · Recipes."}]},{"type":"text","value":" Variant tables for the components that have variants, plus the\nshared chrome — a focus ring, an overlay surface, a menu surface — so twelve\ncomponents do not each invent their own."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"5 · Primitives."}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-type\">Box</span>","source":"Box"}},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-type\">Stack</span>","source":"Stack"}},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-type\">Text</span>","source":"Text"}},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-type\">Icon</span>","source":"Icon"}},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-type\">Link</span>","source":"Link"}},{"type":"text","value":": thin elements that\ncarry the system's defaults and nothing else."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"6 · Components."}]},{"type":"text","value":" The real thing. Each takes "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" last, so callers can override\nwithout forking."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"rules-that-keep-it-from-drifting","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rules that keep it from drifting"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A colour is one "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-function\">light-dark</span>()","source":"light-dark()"}},{"type":"text","value":" pair"}]},{"type":"text","value":", written once. No dark variant anywhere."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A parent hands values down through context tokens"}]},{"type":"text","value":", never through class\nnames it hopes a child reads."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A component's variants live in its recipe"}]},{"type":"text","value":", not scattered through the JSX."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"New things have one home"}]},{"type":"text","value":": a scale value goes to the scales, a per-mode\ncolour to the semantic layer, a parent-to-child value to the context tokens, a\ngroup or peer to the relations."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Global CSS is the last resort"}]},{"type":"text","value":", for markup you do not render."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"what-the-compiler-gives-you-here","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What the compiler gives you here"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A design system is mostly discipline, and the compiler enforces some of it for\nyou: "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" that goes nowhere is a warning, a relation without an anchor is an\nerror, two conditions that could both apply are reported, and a mixed\nlogical/physical box is flagged. Those are precisely the mistakes that make a\nsystem slowly stop being one."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"building-a-design-system","text":"Building a design system","level":1},{"id":"six-layers","text":"Six layers","level":2},{"id":"rules-that-keep-it-from-drifting","text":"Rules that keep it from drifting","level":2},{